            {
              "label": "Positive real L² operator: actual complexification",
              "tex": "\\operatorname{Fix}(C)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\iota),\\quad D_{\\mathbb C}(\\iota a+i\\iota b)=\\iota Da+i\\iota Db,\\quad D_{\\mathbb C}\\ge0,\\quad D_{\\mathbb C}\\iota=\\iota D,\\quad CD_{\\mathbb C}=D_{\\mathbb C}C."
