            "assumptions": [
              "Let Ω be an arbitrary measurable space, μ any measure, and D a bounded positive real-linear endomorphism of L²(μ;ℝ). Positivity includes selfadjointness. Define the actual quotient maps ιu=u+0i, Rg=Re g, Qg=Im g and Cg=conj(g) via Mathlib compLpL.",
              "No finite/probability measure, finite-dimensional L2, nontriviality, chosen embedding or CFC input.",
